{
  "slug": "rayden-ui-design-skill",
  "name": "Rayden Ui Design Skill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate React code and build Figma designs with the Rayden UI component library. Includes full component API reference, design tokens, craft rules, anti-patterns, and layout patterns",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `rayden-code` (Generate React code with Rayden UI components using correct props, tokens, and premium layout patterns), `rayden-use` (Build and maintain Rayden UI components and screens in Figma via Figma MCP with full design token enforcement).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install rayden-ui-design-skill@claude-community` from `playbookTV/rayden-ui-design-skill`.",
